---

## Phase Transitions

```
research → architecture → planning → implementation → review → documentation → complete
                                                          ↓
                                                        fix (review_iteration 1-3)
                                                    (only failing_experts re-review)
                                                          ↓
                                                        review
                                                          ↓ (if still failing at 3)
                                                        blocked
```

### Resume Mapping

| current_phase | Action |
|--------------|--------|
| `research` | Spawn Research Agent |
| `architecture` | Spawn Architecture Agent |
| `planning` | Spawn Planning Agent |
| `implementation` | Spawn Implementation Agent |
| `review` | Spawn all three review agents (parallel) |
| `fix` | Spawn Fix Agent, then re-spawn `failing_experts` agents |
| `documentation` | Spawn Tech Writer Agent |
| `complete` | Report complete |
| `blocked` | Report blocked, show REVIEW.md |
